      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toujours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answered a question about the heating schedule.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réponse à une question sur le programme du chauffage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approval needed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Approbation requise"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arthur asked about the backup; Hermes quoted restic's error.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arthur pose une question sur la sauvegarde ; Hermes cite l’erreur de restic."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arthur asked for the server's uptime; Hermes reported 41 days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arthur demande depuis quand le serveur tourne ; Hermes répond 41 jours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arthur asked what happened with the backup; Hermes showed restic's error and asked before pruning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arthur demande ce qui est arrivé à la sauvegarde ; Hermes montre l’erreur de restic et demande avant de supprimer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arthur: go ahead and prune, but keep the March snapshots.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arthur : vas-y, supprime, mais garde les instantanés de mars."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demander"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask without interrupting the turn": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demande sans interrompre le tour en cours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back up one turn": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revient un tour en arrière"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Booked it, shared the address with Léa, added the passport reminder for February.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réservé, adresse partagée avec Léa, rappel du passeport ajouté pour février."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Booked the Alfama flat (€420 for three nights). Léa confirmed Saturday dinner. Arthur asked for a reminder to renew his passport before March.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appartement d’Alfama réservé (420 € pour trois nuits). Léa confirme le dîner de samedi. Arthur demande un rappel pour renouveler son passeport avant mars."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both restarts were launchd bringing it back after a crash in the Telegram adapter, at 14:02 and 17:45. The second log line says `RetryAfter: 29`; it hit a flood limit while editing a long draft. I've opened a fix on a branch: `fix/telegram-flood-wait`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les deux redémarrages, à 14:02 et 17:45, viennent de launchd qui l’a relancée après un plantage de l’adaptateur Telegram. La deuxième ligne du journal dit `RetryAfter: 29` : elle a atteint une limite de débit en modifiant un long brouillon. J’ai ouvert un correctif sur une branche : `fix/telegram-flood-wait`."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can you check why the Hermes gateway restarted twice yesterday?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu peux regarder pourquoi la passerelle Hermes a redémarré deux fois hier ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can you look at this? %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu peux regarder ça ? %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change a rule": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modifier une règle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked a deduction's rules.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Règles d’une déduction vérifiées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked the backup logs and the disk's free space.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Journaux de sauvegarde et espace libre du disque vérifiés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked the flight's gate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Porte d’embarquement vérifiée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked the media share's free space.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Espace libre du partage multimédia vérifié."
