        }
      }
    },
    "Error": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erreur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Essays, volume %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Essais, volume %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every action but reads waits for your yes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toute action autre qu’une lecture attend ton accord."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find a quiet place to stay near Alfama, 3 nights from the 14th": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trouve un logement calme près d’Alfama, 3 nuits à partir du 14"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First week: installed nix-darwin and Hermes, paired the Telegram bot, chose the models, and tested the memory on a few old notes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Première semaine : nix-darwin et Hermes installés, bot Telegram associé, modèles choisis, mémoire testée sur quelques vieilles notes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fixed a failing Home Assistant automation after a firmware update.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatisation Home Assistant réparée après une mise à jour de firmware."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forget this sub-chat's key until unlocked": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oublie la clé de cette sous-discussion jusqu’au prochain déverrouillage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found 41 snapshots older than 90 days, the oldest from 12 March. Deleting them needs your go-ahead: once pruned, restic can't bring": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J’ai trouvé 41 instantanés de plus de 90 jours, le plus ancien du 12 mars. Les supprimer demande ton accord : une fois élagués, restic ne pourra pas les"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found a restaurant for Saturday.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restaurant trouvé pour samedi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fri": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ven."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go ahead and prune, but keep the March snapshots.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vas-y, supprime, mais garde les instantanés de mars."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Good morning! Three things overnight: the **nightly backup failed** at 03:12, Léa replied about Saturday, and your Lisbon flight is now boarding at gate 34 on Thursday.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bonjour ! Trois choses cette nuit : la **sauvegarde nocturne a échoué** à 03:12, Léa a répondu pour samedi, et ton vol pour Lisbonne embarque désormais porte 34 jeudi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Got it, I sent Léa the link with a note that it expires in 10 days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bien reçu, j’ai envoyé le lien à Léa en précisant qu’il expire dans 10 jours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Here's the video from Saturday for Léa": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voici la vidéo de samedi pour Léa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermes couldn't read its memory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermes n’a pas pu lire sa mémoire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermes didn't answer in time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermes n’a pas répondu à temps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermes offered to prune the old snapshots and asked for a go-ahead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermes propose de supprimer les vieux instantanés et demande le feu vert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermes wants to delete the backup snapshots older than 90 days on the external disk, freeing about 212 GB. Auto mode asks because deleting can't be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermes veut supprimer les instantanés de sauvegarde de plus de 90 jours sur le disque externe, ce qui libère environ 212 Go. Le mode auto demande, car une suppression est définitive."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermes worked out that pruning past 90 days frees 212 GB, and waited for Arthur.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermes calcule que supprimer au-delà de 90 jours libère 212 Go, et attend Arthur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermes works on it across turns until reached": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermes y travaille de tour en tour jusqu’à l’atteindre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermes' memory isn't available on the server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La mémoire d’Hermes n’est pas disponible sur le serveur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold ${/hotel}": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réserver ${/hotel}"
