    "Home Assistant moved to the Mac; Hermes learned the house's devices and the evening routine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Home Assistant passe sur le Mac ; Hermes apprend les appareils de la maison et la routine du soir."
