          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lift the emergency stop": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lève l’arrêt d’urgence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lisbon on Thursday: **21 °C** and sunny, wind 14 km/h, 5 % chance of rain. The next days: 23, 24, 20 and 19 °C.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lisbonne jeudi : **21 °C** et du soleil, vent à 14 km/h, 5 % de risque de pluie. Les jours suivants : 23, 24, 20 et 19 °C."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lisbon on Thursday: **21°C** and sunny, a light breeze off the river in the evening. Pack a thin jacket.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lisbonne jeudi : **21 °C** et du soleil, une légère brise du fleuve le soir. Prends une veste légère."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lisbon trip": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voyage à Lisbonne"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lisbon, Thursday": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lisbonne, jeudi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lisbon: flights compared, Thursday 10:40 from Orly chosen; Léa joins on Friday.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lisbonne : vols comparés, jeudi 10:40 depuis Orly choisi ; Léa arrive vendredi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listed the documents for the 2026 return: payslips, the rent receipts, two donation receipts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Documents de la déclaration 2026 listés : bulletins de paie, quittances de loyer, deux reçus de dons."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listed what to pack.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Liste des affaires à emporter faite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lock": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verrouiller"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looked at flats in Alfama and Graça; the Alfama one has a terrace and a quiet street.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appartements regardés à Alfama et Graça ; celui d’Alfama a une terrasse et une rue calme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looked at the router's logs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Journaux du routeur consultés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looked up the tram to the castle.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
