      }
    },
    "The agents and tasks running now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les agents et les tâches en cours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The backup failed at 03:12: the external disk was full. Hermes proposed pruning snapshots older than 90 days, about 212 GB.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La sauvegarde a échoué à 03:12 : le disque externe était plein. Hermes propose de supprimer les instantanés de plus de 90 jours, environ 212 Go."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The deduction for the home office applies; Hermes filled in the form's draft.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La déduction pour le bureau à domicile s’applique ; Hermes remplit le brouillon du formulaire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The external disk was full, so restic stopped before pruning:\n```\nFatal: unable to save snapshot: no space left on device\n```\nPruning snapshots older than 90 days would free about **212 GB**. Want me to do it?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le disque externe était plein, donc restic s’est arrêté avant le nettoyage :\n```\nFatal: unable to save snapshot: no space left on device\n```\nSupprimer les instantanés de plus de 90 jours libérerait environ **212 Go**. Je le fais ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The living room plug kept dropping off Wi-Fi: moved it to the 2.4 GHz network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La prise du salon perdait le Wi-Fi : passée sur le réseau 2,4 GHz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
